# The trained models and their corpus ARE committed on purpose: they are the
# deliverable for Objective 4, and committing them means the project runs
# straight from a clone without a training step. They are also rebuilt at
# deploy time (see render.yaml) so the artefacts always match the installed
# scikit-learn version.

